# MQ07 "Spies". MQ06 100 set MQ07 10: Martin sends the player to Jauffre about Mythic Dawn agents watching Cloud
# Ruler Temple. Jauffre asks for them to be found (20); Steffan has seen them at the runestone at dusk (25). The two
# agents are Saveri Faram (her death sets 31) and Jearl (30); either death sets 35. Jearl's orders in her basement
# in Bruma name both agents (80). Shown the orders with both dead, Jauffre is satisfied (90), and Martin's greeting
# at 90 ends the quest (100).
# DRAFT from tools/live/quest_brief.py (2026-11-12): not run yet.

# Jauffre: "Spies" offers "I will find these spies." (INFO 00020076, 20). Steffan: "Spies" (INFO 00020077, 25).
case mq07_jauffre_steffan
until 300 GetStage MQ07 >= 10
run
player.moveto JauffreRef
wait 120
approach JauffreRef
# His say-once GREETING 0002006A ("I hope Martin knows ...", no choices) comes first unless an idle hello spent it;
# the conversation then ends, and the next talk gives 0002006B, whose choices start with "Spies".
talk JauffreRef
wait 60
bye if open
approach JauffreRef
talk JauffreRef
ask "Spies"
ask "I will find these spies."
until 300 GetStage MQ07 >= 20
bye if open
run
player.moveto SteffanRef
wait 120
approach SteffanRef
talk SteffanRef
ask "Spies"
until 300 GetStage MQ07 >= 25
bye if open
end

# The player hunts the two agents down: kill stands in for each fight. SaveriFaramScript OnDeath sets 31,
# JearlScript OnDeath 30; each adds 1 to MQ07.deadAgentCount, and the first death sets 35.
case mq07_kill_spies
run
player.moveto SaveriFaramRef
wait 120
run
SaveriFaramRef.kill
until 300 GetStageDone MQ07 31
run
player.moveto JearlRef
wait 120
run
JearlRef.kill
until 300 GetStageDone MQ07 30
until 300 GetStageDone MQ07 35
until 300 MQ07.deadAgentCount == 2
end

# Jearl's orders lie in her basement in Bruma (placed book 0006719D, MQ07BrumaEnemyPlans); reading them sets 80
# (JearlsOrdersScript OnActivate).
case mq07_jearls_orders
console coc BrumaJearlsHouseBasement
wait 120
run
player.moveto 0006719D
wait 60
activate 0006719D
until 300 GetStage MQ07 >= 80
close Book Menu
take 0006719D
end

# Jauffre: "[Show Jauffre Jearl's orders]" with both agents dead (INFO 00020085) sets 90. Martin's greeting at 90
# ("I've deciphered part of the ritual ...", INFO 0002006E) sets 100.
case mq07_report
run
player.moveto JauffreRef
wait 120
approach JauffreRef
talk JauffreRef
ask "[Show Jauffre Jearl's orders]"
until 300 GetStage MQ07 >= 90
bye if open
run
player.moveto MartinRef
wait 120
approach MartinRef
talk MartinRef
until 600 GetStageDone MQ07 100
bye if open
end
